遂斬於閶闔門外，徇首六軍。諸黨屬皆夷三族。幽其子淮陵王超、樂安王冰、濟陽王英于金墉。暴冏屍於西明亭，三日而莫敢收斂。冏故掾屬荀闓等表乞殯葬，許之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p014:m0147","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"長沙王乂","kind":"person","person_id":"4c6_984_9ed","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p014:m0148","start":11,"end":12,"surface":"冏","kind":"person","person_id":"ee0_b2a_68e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p014:m0149","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"冏","kind":"person","person_id":"ee0_b2a_68e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p014:m0150","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"董艾","kind":"person","person_id":"nb1_pou_zx4","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p014:m0151","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"乂","kind":"person","person_id":"4c6_984_9ed","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p014:m0152","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"宋洪","kind":"person","person_id":"g6f_ipx_w99","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p014:m0153","start":43,"end":44,"surface":"冏","kind":"person","person_id":"ee0_b2a_68e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p014:m0154","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"王湖","kind":"person","person_id":"9h5_5ob_ufs","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p014:m0155","start":60,"end":63,"surface":"長沙王","kind":"person","person_id":"4c6_984_9ed","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p014:m0156","start":67,"end":68,"surf